('Mobile and location','Passed within stated scope','ODK form version/title/name-field checks passed on odk.nigeriag2p.com and g2p-odk.wverve.in. Android signing/build and manual-upload transport tests passed. Browser geolocation branches were simulated. Physical-device behavior remains unverified for v0.7.'),
