section('Five older ODK submissions: resolved',[
('Original-source review','Completed','All five submissions use archived form version 2026110401. That form collected consent, reported area, household counts and a sample reference, but not household or household-head names. The original archived definition was retrieved, and exact source/definition hashes were verified through both ODK domains. The records are legacy demonstration samples, not verified real households.'),
('Authorized synthetic enrichment','Applied narrowly','The user explicitly instructed that synthetic household and head names be added. Each imported name begins with Synthetic and the household label includes legacy demo. Added names are recorded in a separate mapping receipt with the authorization, original source hash and normalized hash. Original ODK XML and archived definitions were not edited.'),
('Safe mapping and approval','Five passed','Only these five source hashes, instance IDs, form/version identities and archived-definition hashes are allowlisted. Other old submissions remain subject to normal validation. Existing consent, reported location and counts are preserved; GPS, altitude, roof and water remain empty because the sources did not supply them. Children under 18 remain source-only. Every intake passed distinct first and second reviewers; no registry record appeared before final approval.'),
('Reference collision and recovery','Resolved','The batch exposed the native reference default of seconds plus one random digit: two requests received the same application reference. Duplicate protection stopped the affected create. Confirmed transaction rollback and absence of both the deterministic record ID and failed submission UUID before releasing that single source. Changed the supported staff API reference format to date plus a 12-character random alphanumeric suffix. Existing references and database uniqueness constraints were retained.'),
('Verification and provenance','Passed','Five records were checked through each registry domain: ten saved-field and synthetic-name screen checks. Ten source checks through the ODK aliases confirmed unchanged originals. Each legacy source has exactly one intake and one registry record after further polling. Seven legacy-mapping tests and six worker regression tests passed. The service still has no approval permission.'),
('Evidence and rollback','Retained','legacy-verification/ contains approved-mappings.json, state.json, final-checks.json, original-source-checks.json, saved API responses, screenshots and test results. The scoped manifest and original sources are private under /opt/openg2p-lab/odk-sync/legacy-review/. before-release/ preserves configuration, ledger and deployment snapshots. Restore only affected configuration after reconciling newer records; do not restore an old ledger over subsequent imports.')])
