section('Final end-to-end server verification',[
('Fresh sources and automatic pickup','Four passed','Submitted one current Household Intake Form and one numeric-choice verification form through each ODK domain. The enabled timer picked up all four without manual import calls. Source XML was read back from Central and mapped with the pinned definitions. These were clearly labelled synthetic tests sent through the API, not recordings of physical-device collection.'),
('Two-reviewer enforcement','Audit verified','Each fresh intake used policy version 2 and recorded two approval decisions by different actors at stages 1 and 2. The registry contained zero corresponding records before review and after stage 1. Only the second approval allowed ingestion, which completed as PROCESSED. First and final reviews used opposite domain aliases. The sync identity was again denied approval access with HTTP 403.'),
('Saved data and screen values','Both domains passed','Retrieved all four records through both registry domains: eight saved-record checks. Household/head names, size, country, status, reported address and coordinates matched source values. Latitude, longitude and altitude displayed correctly. Four numeric-record screen checks displayed Corrugated iron and Piped for the stored registry codes. Existing backend and validation rules were retained.'),
('Replay, reference and regression checks','Passed','Eight replay attempts across the ODK aliases returned 409 duplicate responses. Subsequent checks found exactly one intake and one registry record per fresh source. All four new application references used the corrected twelve-character suffix. Twenty-one mapper, legacy-enrichment and worker tests passed, including invalid-code rejection, uncertain-create protection, repeated delivery and excluded-source change detection.'),
('Operational state','Healthy at final check','The one-minute timer was enabled and active. The latest scheduled pass reported seventeen submitted sources and two closed EXCLUDED_TEST fixtures, with zero active quarantines and zero transient failures. The five earlier synthetic legacy imports and the two excluded negative fixtures retained their reviewed dispositions.'),
('Hardware boundary','Still pending','Both public v0.7 APK downloads returned successfully and matched the verified SHA-256. ADB listed no connected devices. This confirms download readiness only; offline storage, Android permissions, real GPS, reconnect behavior and physical upload still require the device acceptance run below. The existing illustrative video is not physical-test evidence.')])
