('Physical-device inputs','Needed from the user','Provide the authorized Android phone/tablet or agreed device matrix, model and Android version, plus a suitable test time. Connect and unlock it by USB and authorize debugging on this computer. Permit installation of the existing test APK, location access and network toggling; identify any existing app data that must be preserved. Use fictional records. Connection credentials can be provisioned privately; do not send passwords in chat.'),
